// The truth of the fair set (S66) for Wilhelm Taubert, 6 Lieder Op.76 No.2, Oh gently sleep (Wenn du im Traum
// wirst fragen): written from the Schirmer print (1870, IMSLP #110522, data/fair/taubert76-2/schirmer), bar by bar.
// Never to debug the reader on. Heads off the staves named by counting the ledger lines (zoomed; in this print a head
// on a ledger line sits high, the line crossing its lower half).
// As the print has them: bars 4-29 are repeated (||: before bar 4, :|| after bar 29); the voice's staff is not
// printed in the first system (removeEmpty all). The right hand's broken chords that run down into the left hand's
// staff (bars 13-14 and their returns) are written where their heads are printed: those on the lower staff as a
// voice of the left hand.
